{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/16596-idea-for-a-new-conspiracy","id":16596,"title":"Idea for a new conspiracy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-23T06:13:27-08:00","id":16596,"title":"Idea for a new conspiracy","content":"So, I was reading through C&amp;C and I couldn't help but feel a shiver down my spine as I read the section of Malleus Maleficarum regarding laity within the organization and how more and more of the conspiracy's members are cops, construction workers, nurses, trash collectors. It made me think; I've heard this before, only much more badass.<br /> <br /> Who else would like to see Project: MAYHEM from Fight Club done up as a H:tV compact or even a conspiracy? I think it'd be more like a compact given their limited budget and decentralized leadership, but it could be very excellent as a group a character could be a part of.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T06:36:48-08:00","id":16607,"title":"","content":"If the Fight Club cult thing is emulated from a position of 'holy crap lois this is badass' then it's pretty much doomed to suck, I think. What you're describing is already a definite thing for a lot of compacts/conspiracies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T07:43:52-08:00","id":16636,"title":"","content":"The Fightclub was first and foremost an egoistic and self-centered organization.<br /> Depressed, burned-out civilizated men came together to experience something primal and true.<br /> Later political goals (the downfall of society, freeing mankind of corporate culture BS) were derived from that.<br /> Most of the Conspiracies fall into the following categories<br /> 1. reaction to a conceived supernatural threat<br /> 2. some guys who see a new business model<br /> 3. curiosity and scientific interest<br /> -&gt;Main exception here: Ashwood Abbey<br /> <br /> The Fightclub could be an average-guy-Ashwood Abbey, torching Vampire havens with Molotovs, beating Werewolves with silver knuckledusters, but if you want that merry anarchistic &quot;I don\u00b4t give a Fxxx&quot;-feeling, they should do it mostly for the fun of it.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, if you can make the supernaturals somehow responsible for some 30-somethings\u00b4 midlife crisis. Then you have a serious motive for a Fight Club Hunter Cell.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1261-doc-lumbago","name":"Doc Lumbago","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1261_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T08:52:17-08:00","id":16652,"title":"","content":"You could make it into a anti-God Machine organization.<br /> <br /> &quot;The God Machine created iPhones, TVs, microwaves and [Insert mid life crisisy rant here]. So we're gong to destroy it, and the society it created so we can return to something primal and true.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T15:59:49-08:00","id":16846,"title":"","content":"Hmmm, that's a good point. Near as I can tell the God Machine does fill that role for the most part. That would provide a pretty good catalyst for such a group. I might have to think on this more, and perhaps see if I can make it work. You are right about it being selfish, as depicted in the movie, and that's not a good thing for a hunter group but I think it could be tweaked to keep the general atmosphere and attitude of Project:MAYHEM without it being quite so unsustainable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T16:27:03-08:00","id":16860,"title":"","content":"Just some thought tht came to me...what if all of Project: MAYHEM are lackeys of some corporate Vampire douchebags...and the first misions start really goofy like<br /> &quot;Your homework for tonight is - get totally wasted on some experimental hallucigenic stuff- then get a Vampire to suck you.&quot;<br /> &quot;Let\u00b4s exchange some sleeping Elders to let them wake up in the wrong haven&quot;<br /> &quot;activate the fire alarm during the Prince\u00b4s New Year\u00b4s speech&quot;<br /> <br /> edit: is that somehow VTM Malkavians MO????","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1261,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1261-doc-lumbago","user":"Doc Lumbago","date":". 11-23-2013, 07:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1261-doc-lumbago","name":"Doc Lumbago","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1261_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T02:56:55-08:00","id":17630,"title":"","content":"Eugh, god no. That sucked for TF:V and it sucks in this instance. The point of Project: MAYHEM is all about decentralized mortals banding together out of a lack of purpose and a perceived hatred for the consumerist world. I imagine that if Fight Club were rewritten today the word 'sheeple' would get tossed around a fair bit.<br /> <br /> And no, Malkavians were nothing like that, or they shouldn't have been like that. Any Malkavian that was played well was a lot more subtle than pulling childish pranks for the lulz.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T05:56:54-08:00","id":17666,"title":"","content":"Are you 13?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T06:31:46-08:00","id":17680,"title":"","content":"Any supernatural that manipulates humans to keep them obeying orders can be targeted by such a group (vampires and seers of the throne come to mind), but i like the God-Machine. Infiltrating cults, burning infraestructure to free the people from the machine that enslaves them all sound quite good.<br /> <br /> Also, it doesnt hurt that the protagonists mentality at the start of the movie reminds to that of an angel (sees deaths as numbers) and that he becomes fascinated with human suffering and pain (almost as if he couldnt experience it). No need to have supernatural basis, but the protagonist (the founder figure) could be a demon fairly easily. &quot;You have met me in a strange time in my life&quot; in deed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/524-angrycucaracha","name":"AngryCucaracha","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T16:16:53-08:00","id":18001,"title":"","content":"I don't quite see it as a conspiracy though. A compact sure, the loose cell-based structure of MAYHEM works well with a conspiracy, but I can't see them organizing the same way a conspiracy does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/483-flyboy254","name":"Flyboy254","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar483_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T17:35:57-08:00","id":18046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leaper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/16596-idea-for-a-new-conspiracy?p=17666#post17666\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are you 13?</div> </div> </div> </div>Do me a favor? Keep that kind of thing to yourself. It's insulting and unnecessary.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/16596-idea-for-a-new-conspiracy?p=18001#post18001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't quite see it as a conspiracy though. A compact sure, the loose cell-based structure of MAYHEM works well with a conspiracy, but I can't see them organizing the same way a conspiracy does.</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally agree, Flyboy, it struck me as a compact rather than a conspiracy as well. The rules of P:M are also uniquely suited to keeping it that way, as well. Much like with the Cainite Heresy in general not caring about the past, it's actually codified within P:M's rules.<br /> <br /> First Rule: You do not ask questions.<br /> Second Rule: YOU DO NOT ASK QUESTIONS.<br /> Third Rule: No excuses.<br /> Fourth Rule: No lies.<br /> Fifth Rule: Trust in Tyler.<br /> <br /> Now, that fifth rule would obviously need to be changed but on the whole that makes for a very interesting structure for a hunter compact. Hell, it's even divided into four committees already.<br /> <br /> Arson Commitee,<br /> Assault Committee.<br /> Mischief Committee.<br /> Misinformation Committee.<br /> <br /> The film also makes mention of a Demolitions Committee right at the start but I think that can be dropped along with the Arson Committee to simplify thing down to keeping it cleanly divided between Information Gathering, Subversion and Distraction, and simply Assault.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/19.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1220-carnivalcash","name":"CarnivalCash","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}